%%{init: {"theme": "neutral", "sequence": {"mirrorActors": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Editor
  actor Approver
  participant Gateway as API Gateway
  participant Workflow as workflow-service
  participant Metadata as metadata-service
  participant Notify as notification-service

  Editor->>Gateway: POST /workflow/:id/submit
  Gateway->>Workflow: Forward JWT + actor context
  Workflow->>Metadata: updateStatus(DRAFT → PENDING)
  Workflow->>Notify: Notify approvers (SUBMITTED)

  Approver->>Gateway: POST /workflow/:id/approve
  Gateway->>Workflow: Forward JWT + actor context
  Workflow->>Metadata: updateStatus(PENDING → PUBLISHED)
  Workflow->>Notify: Notify owner (APPROVED)

  Note over Workflow,Metadata: Các service gọi nhau bằng Axios HTTP nội bộ (không qua message queue). Mỗi lần đổi trạng thái đều ghi workflow history và audit event.
